#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""kich-dpi: a small zapret2 DPI bypass manager for Omarchy.

The plugin intentionally has no host lists, presets or tabs. It generates
nfqws2 configurations from a handful of primitives, measures them against a
few blocked services, and keeps the best one. Everything the QML panel needs
comes from one JSON object on stdout.

Run `kich-dpi --help` for the command list.
"""

